@startuml state-goose
title Goose - State Machine (v1)
[*] --> Chasing : spawned\n[FR_GEESE_SPAWN]
Chasing --> Distracted : item used in range\n[FR_USE_ITEM]
Distracted --> Chasing : distraction ends
Distracted --> Dispersed : hunger satisfied\n[FR_GEESE_DISPERSE, A2]
Chasing --> Dispersed : hunger satisfied
Dispersed --> [*] : removed from map
@enduml
